es.s08.map.step3.output2\">标识主题分析报告</li></ul></div></article>\n    <article class=\"rm-step\"><div class=\"rm-step-no\">04</div><div class=\"rm-method\"><strong data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.step4.title\">定量眼动验证</strong><div class=\"rm-method-participants\"><svg class=\"lucide rm-participant-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg><div><span data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.people.visitors\">游客</span><span data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.people.designers\">设计师</span></div></div></div><div class=\"rm-technique rm-tool-method rm-output--quantitative\"><img src=\"asset:visual-attention-banner\" alt=\"SIGN Visual Attention v3 logo\"><div><span>QUANTITATIVE TOOL</span><strong data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.step4.output\">SIGN Visual Attention v3</strong></div></div><div class=\"rm-output rm-output-list\"><span>OUTPUTS</span><ul><li data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.step4.output1\">SIGN Visual Attention v3</li><li data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.step4.output2\">热力图</li><li data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.step4.output3\">注视点路径图</li><li data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.step4.output4\">反馈</li></ul></div></article>\n    <div class=\"rm-tool-arrow rm-tool-arrow--qual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"rm-tool-arrow__label\"><span>Validation</span><span lang=\"ja\">検証</span></span></div><div class=\"rm-tool-arrow rm-tool-arrow--quant\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"rm-columns rm-columns--bottom\" aria-label=\"Research map columns\"><span data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.objectiveLabel\">研究目的</span><span>STEP</span><span data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.phaseLabel\">步骤与参与者</span><span data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.methodLabel\">研究方法</span><span data-i18n=\"slides.s08.map.outcomeLabel\">研究成果</span></div>\n</div>"
